<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Hampton University Application Booklet</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-size: 48pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 16pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .sub-section-title {
    font-size: 12pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .label {
    font-weight: bold;
    display: inline-block;
    width: 150px; /* Adjust as needed for alignment */
  }
  .input-field {
    border-bottom: 1px solid black;
    min-width: 200px;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .table-header th {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 5px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid black;
  }
  .table-row td {
    padding: 5px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc;
  }
  .centered {
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>

<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="centered" style="margin-top: 100px;">
    <div class="header-title">HAMPTON UNIVERSITY</div>
    <div class="header-title" style="font-size: 36pt;">APPLICATION BOOKLET</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="centered" style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Hampton University Logo" style="width: 200px; height: auto;">
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <div style="font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">ADMISSION INFORMATION | FINANCIAL AID INFORMATION | UNDERGRADUATE APPLICATION</div>
    <div style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 20px;">8/08</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">HAMPTON UNIVERSITY ADMISSION INFORMATION</div>

  <div class="sub-section-title">ADMISSION TIMELINE</div>
  <p>Candidates may apply for admission as early as the end of their junior year of high school. The Early Action (non-binding) deadline is November 1 and decision letters are mailed the fourth week of December. The standard admission application deadline is March 1 and decision letters are mailed on a rolling basis. Applicants who wish to be considered for financial aid must submit the FAFSA early enough for the U.S. Department of Education to process the application and have it arrive at Hampton University's Financial Aid Office by March 1st for Fall admission or December 1st for Spring admission. To reserve space in the freshman class, it is recommended that you submit your application for admission prior to November 1.</p>

  <div class="sub-section-title">FIRST-YEAR CANDIDATES</div>
  <p>A completed application packet for first-year applicants consists of:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>The signed and completed application form</li>
    <li>Official SAT/ACT scores or, for non-U.S. citizens, Test of English as a Foreign Language (TOEFL) scores and a copy of the national examination results</li>
    <li>Official high school transcript</li>
    <li>Official GED scores (if applicable)</li>
    <li>A personal essay</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="sub-section-title">PERSONAL CHECKS ARE NOT ACCEPTED.</div>
  <p>Submit complete application packet to the Office of Admission, Hampton University, Hampton, VA 23668. Only completed packets will be reviewed.</p>

  <div class="sub-section-title">TRANSFER CANDIDATES</div>
  <p>A transfer student is one who graduated from high school, has attended another college or university and has satisfactorily completed at least 15 semester hours of college coursework. Students who have earned a grade point average of 2.5 or higher have the best chance for admission.</p>

  <div class="sub-section-title">A completed application packet for transfer candidates consists of:</div>
  <ul>
    <li>The signed and completed application form</li>
    <li>Official SAT/ACT scores (if you have less than 30 college credit hours) or, for non-U.S. citizens, Test of English as a Foreign Language (TOEFL) scores and a copy of the national examination results</li>
    <li>Official high school transcript (if you have less than 30 college credit hours)</li>
    <li>Essay</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="sub-section-title">PROCEDURES FOR COMPLETING DOCUMENTS</div>
  <p>Please be sure to include your name and your Social Security number on all documents. Use only your correct legal name at the time of application to the college. If your name or address changes prior to the time of registration, please notify the Office of Admission.</p>
  <p>Use the abbreviations on the inside front cover to respond to the numbered items.</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">HAMPTON UNIVERSITY FINANCIAL AID INFORMATION</div>

  <div class="sub-section-title">PURPOSE</div>
  <p>Hampton University's Financial Aid Program exists to help students who have strong academic potential and limited financial resources. The fundamental purpose is to provide financial assistance to students who would not be able to attend the University without such aid.</p>

  <div class="sub-section-title">HOW TO APPLY</div>
  <p>The Free Application for Federal Student Aid (FAFSA) is the application for Federal Student Aid at Hampton University. All students applying for aid must also apply for admission to the University. Financial aid awards are made only after admission to the University. A completed FAFSA must that the data be processed by the Federal Processor with a request that the data be sent to Hampton University's Federal Student Aid Office. The FAFSA is accessible at <span data-field="fafsa_url">{{ fafsa_url }}</span>.</p>
  <p>Families should file the FAFSA early in January in order to ensure that the data is processed by the Federal Processor and forwarded to Hampton's Financial Aid Office by the March 1st deadline. Simply filing the FAFSA by the March 1st deadline is not sufficient for priority consideration. For further information about financial aid programs, policies, and procedures, please contact the Office of Financial Aid and Scholarships by calling 1-800-624-3341 or email: <span data-field="financial_aid_email">{{ financial_aid_email }}</span>.</p>

  <div class="sub-section-title">IMPORTANT DATES</div>
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <thead>
      <tr class="table-header">
        <th style="width: 30%;">After January 1</th>
        <th style="width: 70%;">Submit completed FAFSA to the Federal Processor</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr class="table-row">
        <td>Feb 1</td>
        <td>Students are strongly encouraged to complete and submit the FAFSA</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="table-row">
        <td>March 1</td>
        <td>Deadline by which Hampton University must receive FAFSA from the Federal Processor for priority consideration</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="table-row">
        <td>July 31</td>
        <td>Deadline for Virginia residents to file for the Virginia Tuition Assistance Grant</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="sub-section-title">SPECIAL PROGRAMS</div>
  <p>All students admitted to Hampton University will be considered for academic achievement awards based on academic credentials on file with the Admission Office. In some cases, additional information will be requested from students being considered as finalists for these special awards.</p>
  <p>Virginia residents should apply for the Virginia Tuition Assistance Grant (TAG). TAG is available to Virginia residents based upon Virginia residency status, using guidelines established by the State Council of Higher Education for Virginia. Applications will be mailed from the Financial Aid Office to entering students.</p>
  <p>Non-Virginia residents are encouraged to apply for financial aid programs in their home states. Schools, social and civic organizations, and employers with financial aid programs are also possible sources of assistance.</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">HAMPTON UNIVERSITY UNDERGRADUATE APPLICATION</div>

  <div class="sub-section-title">PERSONAL DATA</div>
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 15%;">Legal Name:</td>
      <td style="width: 35%;">Last/Family: <span data-field="personal_data.last_name">{{ personal_data.last_name }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 35%;">First: <span data-field="personal_data.first_name">{{ personal_data.first_name }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 15%;">Middle (Complete): <span data-field="personal_data.middle_name">{{ personal_data.middle_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Maiden Name:</td>
      <td colspan="3"><span data-field="personal_data.maiden_name">{{ personal_data.maiden_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>You are applying as a:</td>
      <td><input type="radio" name="applicant_type" value="student"> Student</td>
      <td><input type="radio" name="applicant_type" value="other"> Other</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>For the term beginning:</td>
      <td><span data-field="personal_data.term_start_year">{{ personal_data.term_start_year }}</span> (Year)</td>
      <td><span data-field="personal_data.term_start_month">{{ personal_data.term_start_month }}</span> (Month)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Permanent home address:</td>
      <td colspan="4"><span data-field="personal_data.permanent_address">{{ personal_data.permanent_address }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>If different from the above, please give your mailing address for all admission correspondence:</td>
      <td colspan="4"><span data-field="personal_data.mailing_address">{{ personal_data.mailing_address }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Mailing address: (use from)</td>
      <td>City or Town: <span data-field="personal_data.mailing_city">{{ personal_data.mailing_city }}</span></td>
      <td>State (3): <span data-field="personal_data.mailing_state">{{ personal_data.mailing_state }}</span></td>
      <td>Country (4): <span data-field="personal_data.mailing_country">{{ personal_data.mailing_country }}</span></td>
      <td>Zip Code or Postal Code: <span data-field="personal_data.mailing_zip">{{ personal_data.mailing_zip }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Telephone at mailing address:</td>
      <td><span data-field="personal_data.mailing_phone">{{ personal_data.mailing_phone }}</span></td>
      <td>Permanent home phone:</td>
      <td><span data-field="personal_data.home_phone">{{ personal_data.home_phone }}</span></td>
      <td>Area Code: <span data-field="personal_data.home_area_code">{{ personal_data.home_area_code }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>E-mail address:</td>
      <td colspan="4"><span data-field="personal_data.email_address">{{ personal_data.email_address }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Gender:</td>
      <td><input type="radio" name="gender" value="male"> Male</td>
      <td><input type="radio" name="gender" value="female"> Female</td>
      <td><input type="radio" name="gender" value="other"> Other</td>
      <td>Ethnicity: <span data-field="personal_data.ethnicity">{{ personal_data.ethnicity }}</span></td>
      <td>Religion: <span data-field="personal_data.religion">{{ personal_data.religion }}</span></td>
      <td>Veteran Status: <span data-field="personal_data.veteran_status">{{ personal_data.veteran_status }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Are you a U.S. citizen?</td>
      <td><input type="radio" name="citizenship" value="yes"> Yes</td>
      <td><input type="radio" name="citizenship" value="no"> No</td>
      <td>Country of Citizenship: <span data-field="personal_data.citizenship_country">{{ personal_data.citizenship_country }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Preferred area(s) of academic concentration / Major:</td>
      <td colspan="4"><span data-field="personal_data.major">{{ personal_data.major }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Acceptance into Hampton University does not constitute admission into your preferred academic major. Several academic majors have separate entrance requirements as indicated by an asterisk.</td>
      <td colspan="4"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>On Campus Housing:</td>
      <td><input type="radio" name="housing" value="yes"> Yes</td>
      <td><input type="radio" name="housing" value="no"> No</td>
      <td>Candidate for financial aid?</td>
      <td><input type="radio" name="financial_aid" value="yes"> Yes</td>
      <td><input type="radio" name="financial_aid" value="no"> No</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="sub-section-title">EDUCATIONAL DATA (Freshmen only)</div>
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 20%;">High school you now attend (or which you graduated):</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Address:</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">City or Town:</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">State:</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Country:</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Date of high school graduation:</td>
      <td><span data-field="educational_data.graduation_date">{{ educational_data.graduation_date }}</span></td>
      <td>Is your school public?</td>
      <td><input type="radio" name="public_school" value="yes"> Yes</td>
      <td><input type="radio" name="public_school" value="no"> No</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>College counselor:</td>
      <td>Name: <span data-field="educational_data.counselor_name">{{ educational_data.counselor_name }}</span></td>
      <td>Counselor's FAX:</td>
      <td><span data-field="educational_data.counselor_fax">{{ educational_data.counselor_fax }}</span></td>
      <td>Position: <span data-field="educational_data.counselor_position">{{ educational_data.counselor_position }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>List all other high schools attended.</td>
      <td colspan="4"><span data-field="educational_data.other_schools">{{ educational_data.other_schools }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Name of school:</td>
      <td colspan="4"><span data-field="educational_data.other_school_name">{{ educational_data.other_school_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>List all colleges/universities at which you have taken courses for credit. Please have an official transcript sent from each institution as soon as possible.</td>
      <td colspan="4"><span data-field="educational_data.college_list">{{ educational_data.college_list }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Name of school:</td>
      <td colspan="4"><span data-field="educational_data.college_name">{{ educational_data.college_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <p style="font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 20px;">*Please note: Information regarding "ethnicity" and "religion" on this application is voluntary. It is kept confidential and will not be a factor in the admission process, however, the information may be used for aggregate statistics as needed.</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">TEST SCORES</div>

  <div class="sub-section-title">ACT</div>
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <thead>
      <tr class="table-header">
        <th style="width: 15%;">Date Taken/Score</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">English</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Math</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Composite</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">To Be Taken</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr class="table-row">
        <td><span data-field="act_scores[0].date">{{ act_scores[0].date }}</span> / <span data-field="act_scores[0].score">{{ act_scores[0].score }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="act_scores[0].english_score">{{ act_scores[0].english_score }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="act_scores[0].math_score">{{ act_scores[0].math_score }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="act_scores[0].composite_score">{{ act_scores[0].composite_score }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="act_scores[0].to_be_taken">{{ act_scores[0].to_be_taken }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="sub-section-title">SAT I</div>
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <thead>
      <tr class="table-header">
        <th style="width: 15%;">Date Taken/Score</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Critical Reading</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Math</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Composite</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">To Be Taken</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr class="table-row">
        <td><span data-field="sat_scores[0].date">{{ sat_scores[0].date }}</span> / <span data-field="sat_scores[0].score">{{ sat_scores[0].score }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="sat_scores[0].critical_reading_score">{{ sat_scores[0].critical_reading_score }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="sat_scores[0].math_score">{{ sat_scores[0].math_score }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="sat_scores[0].composite_score">{{ sat_scores[0].composite_score }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="sat_scores[0].to_be_taken">{{ sat_scores[0].to_be_taken }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="sub-section-title">Test Of English As A Foreign Language (TOEFL)</div>
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <thead>
      <tr class="table-header">
        <th style="width: 15%;">Date Taken/Score</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Reading</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Listening</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Speaking</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Writing</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr class="table-row">
        <td><span data-field="toefl_scores[0].date">{{ toefl_scores[0].date }}</span> / <span data-field="toefl_scores[0].score">{{ toefl_scores[0].score }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="toefl_scores[0].reading_score">{{ toefl_scores[0].reading_score }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="toefl_scores[0].listening_score">{{ toefl_scores[0].listening_score }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="toefl_scores[0].speaking_score">{{ toefl_scores[0].speaking_score }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="toefl_scores[0].writing_score">{{ toefl_scores[0].writing_score }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="sub-section-title">FAMILY</div>
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Mother's full name:</td>
      <td colspan="3"><span data-field="family.mother_full_name">{{ family.mother_full_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Home address if different from yours:</td>
      <td colspan="3"><span data-field="family.mother_address">{{ family.mother_address }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Father's full name:</td>
      <td colspan="3"><span data-field="family.father_full_name">{{ family.father_full_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Home address if different from yours:</td>
      <td colspan="3"><span data-field="family.father_address">{{ family.father_address }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="sub-section-title">OCCUPATION</div>
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Name of business or organization:</td>
      <td colspan="3"><span data-field="occupation.business_name">{{ occupation.business_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>College (if any):</td>
      <td colspan="3"><span data-field="occupation.college_name">{{ occupation.college_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Degree:</td>
      <td colspan="3"><span data-field="occupation.degree">{{ occupation.degree }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Professional or graduate school (if any):</td>
      <td colspan="3"><span data-field="occupation.professional_school">{{ occupation.professional_school }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Name of business or organization:</td>
      <td colspan="3"><span data-field="occupation_2.business_name">{{ occupation_2.business_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>College (if any):</td>
      <td colspan="3"><span data-field="occupation_2.college_name">{{ occupation_2.college_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Degree:</td>
      <td colspan="3"><span data-field="occupation_2.degree">{{ occupation_2.degree }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Professional or graduate school (if any):</td>
      <td colspan="3"><span data-field="occupation_2.professional_school">{{ occupation_2.professional_school }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="sub-section-title">ACADEMIC HONORS</div>
  <p>Briefly describe any scholastic distinctions or honors you have won, beginning with ninth grade:</p>
  <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; min-height: 50px;">
    <span data-field="academic_honors">{{ academic_honors }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="sub-section-title">CHARACTER QUESTIONS</div>
  <p>Have you ever been suspended from high school? <input type="radio" name="suspended" value="yes"> Yes <input type="radio" name="suspended" value="no"> No If "Yes", please provide the date(s) and specific circumstances on a separate sheet to be submitted with this application.</p>
  <p>Have you ever been charged with a crime? <input type="radio" name="charged" value="yes"> Yes <input type="radio" name="charged" value="no"> No If "Yes", please give date(s) and nature(s) of offense:</p>
  <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; min-height: 50px;"><span data-field="crime_details">{{ crime_details }}</span></div>

  <div class="sub-section-title">ESSAY</div>
  <p>This essay helps us become acquainted with you in ways different from courses, grades, test scores and other objective data. We are looking for an essay that will help us know you as a person and as a student. Please write an essay on one of the following topics: Describe a personal moral or ethical dilemma and how it impacted your life, or an autobiographical essay.</p>
  <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; min-height: 150px;"><span data-field="essay_content">{{ essay_content }}</span></div>

  <div class="sub-section-title">ALL FRESHMEN APPLICANTS MUST SIGN BELOW</div>
  <p>I understand that any falsification of any information given in this application for admission will result in a re-evaluation of my admission to Hampton University.</p>
  <p>Signature: _________________________ Date: _________________________</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">HAMPTON UNIVERSITY EDUCATIONAL DATA (TRANSFERS ONLY)</div>

  <p>List all colleges/universities attended since high school. Please request an official transcript from each institution previously attended. Official transcripts should be received by this office within two weeks of receipt of your application.</p>

  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <thead>
      <tr class="table-header">
        <th style="width: 25%;">College Name</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Location (City, State)</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Dates Attended</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;"># of Credits Completed</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Grade Point Average</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in transfer_schools %}
      <tr class="table-row">
        <td><span data-field="transfer_schools[{{ loop.index0 }}].college_name">{{ transfer_schools[loop.index0].college_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="transfer_schools[{{ loop.index0 }}].location">{{ transfer_schools[loop.index0].location }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="transfer_schools[{{ loop.index0 }}].dates_attended">{{ transfer_schools[loop.index0].dates_attended }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="transfer_schools[{{ loop.index0 }}].credits_completed">{{ transfer_schools[loop.index0].credits_completed }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="transfer_schools[{{ loop.index0 }}].gpa">{{ transfer_schools[loop.index0].gpa }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="sub-section-title">IMPORTANT NOTES:</div>
